{"updated":"2026-11-11T18:58:51.119Z","text":"Good evening, sir. Over the last twenty-four hours, the story leading the world is this: More than one million people in Lebanon face acute food shortages, UN says. Elsewhere, will Sheikh Hasina return to Bangladesh?. And schools in Italy, Scotland and Northern Ireland hit by threats in suspected bomb hoax. All of which keeps the conflict picture centred on Ukraine, at active conflict levels, though US, and Iran are worth keeping an eye on as well. The markets, for their part, felt the weight of it — the S&P 500 down 2.1 percent, the Dow Jones Industrial up 1.6 percent, and the Nasdaq Composite down 6.4 percent. The earth itself has been busier, with 30 tremors above magnitude two and a half — the strongest a 5.1 near 80 km W of Panguna, Papua New Guinea. And overhead, space weather is calm — nothing of concern. That is the shape of the day, sir. The board is yours.","times":[0,0.12,0.16,0.21,0.23,0.28,0.34,0.37,0.42,0.45,0.5,0.52,0.56,0.59,0.61,0.66,0.78,0.87,1,1.28,1.39,1.43,1.46,1.49,1.53,1.56,1.58,1.6,1.65,1.7,1.76,1.82,1.88,1.9,1.95,2,2.03,2.07,2.13,2.17,2.22,2.25,2.3,2.35,2.39,2.44,2.47,2.53,2.59,2.66,2.77,2.89,3.04,3.08,3.11,3.15,3.2,3.24,3.3,3.39,3.47,3.53,3.6,3.63,3.69,3.73,3.77,3.82,3.84,3.87,3.91,3.94,3.96,3.98,4.03,4.08,4.16,4.21,4.28,4.37,4.43,4.55,4.59,4.64,4.67,4.72,4.82,4.97,5.12,5.63,5.7,5.76,5.8,5.83,5.86,5.89,5.91,5.96,6,6.07,6.14,6.21,6.25,6.3,6.34,6.38,6.42,6.46,6.5,6.55,6.58,6.65,6.7,6.76,6.8,6.86,6.91,6.95,7,7.04,7.08,7.15,7.19,7.26,7.3,7.35,7.41,7.46,7.54,7.78,7.87,7.96,8.02,8.08,8.13,8.21,8.3,8.42,8.47,8.52,8.57,8.6,8.67,8.74,8.79,8.84,8.87,8.92,8.97,9.02,9.08,9.15,9.21,9.32,9.41,9.51,9.6,9.75,9.93,10.04,10.09,10.21,10.25,10.38,10.53,10.91,11.03,11.09,11.13,11.19,11.23,11.29,11.32,11.38,11.49,11.52,11.63,11.7,11.77,11.81,11.84,11.9,11.94,12,12.03,12.06,12.11,12.14,12.17,12.21,12.27,12.36,12.48,12.55,12.62,12.7,12.75,12.8,12.88,12.95,13,13.06,13.12,13.15,13.18,13.23,13.27,13.34,13.37,13.43,13.48,1